'' RUN: std/outcome -- an empty Optional's Value( ) raises at the CALLER'S line, with a message:
'' __CALLER_LINE__ / __CALLER_FILE__ as Value( )'s defaults, lowered at the call. ERR stays 1 and
'' ERL is the caller's line under 'on local error'; Result's Failure( ) the same; a byref
'' 'o.Value( ) = 43' still assigns.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/optional-caller-line.tiko -o tests/codegen/optcallerline.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/optcallerline.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: caught 1 7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: caught 1 18
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: byref 43
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: Aborting due to runtime error 1 (illegal function call) at line 32 of
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: optional-caller-line.tiko(), Value( ) of an empty Optional
